{"id":"3a560d130315ebdc","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-structure.md","title":"S-Structure","display":"df-structure — S-Structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-structure","aliases":["88-df-structure"],"display":"df-structure — S-Structure","depends_on":["[[88-df-symbol]]","[[88-df-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-structure — S-Structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-structure-—-S-Structure-$\\mathfrak{A}$\">df-structure — S-Structure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (candidate signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\)</span> (well-formed-signature predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> (candidate coded structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,C,F,R\">\\(A,C,F,R\\)</span> (candidate components)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(F_n)_{n\\geq1}\">\\(F=(F_n)_{n\\geq1}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=(R_n)_{n\\geq1}\">\\(R=(R_n)_{n\\geq1}\\)</span> (interpretation families)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-structure predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> (domain projection)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A,C,(F_n)_{n\\geq1},(R_n)_{n\\geq1}\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,C,(F_n)_{n\\geq1},(R_n)_{n\\geq1}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Language}(S)\n\\land A\\neq\\emptyset\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land C:\\mathrm{Const}_S\\to A\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\n\\bigl(F_n:\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\to A^{A^n}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\n\\bigl(R_n:\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\to\\mathcal P(A^n)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A,C,(F_n)_{n\\geq1},(R_n)_{n\\geq1}\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,C,(F_n)_{n\\geq1},(R_n)_{n\\geq1}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Language}(S)\n\\land A\\neq\\emptyset\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land C:\\mathrm{Const}_S\\to A\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\n\\bigl(F_n:\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\to A^{A^n}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\n\\bigl(R_n:\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\to\\mathcal P(A^n)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,C,(F_n)_{n\\geq1},(R_n)_{n\\geq1}\\rangle\\to\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)=A\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(c^{\\mathfrak A}=C(c))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\n(f^{\\mathfrak A}=F_n(f))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\n(P^{\\mathfrak A}=R_n(P)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,C,(F_n)_{n\\geq1},(R_n)_{n\\geq1}\\rangle\\to\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)=A\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(c^{\\mathfrak A}=C(c))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\n(f^{\\mathfrak A}=F_n(f))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\n(P^{\\mathfrak A}=R_n(P)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> : S-结构（使用Fraktur字体)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> : 由编码的第一坐标唯一确定的论域</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c^{\\mathfrak{A}}\">\\(c^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\)</span> : 常量<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span>中的解释 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{\\mathfrak{A}}\">\\(f^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\)</span> : 函数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span>中的解释 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\mathfrak{A}}\">\\(R^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\)</span> : 关系<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span>中的解释 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,F,R\">\\(C,F,R\\)</span>分别统一编码常量解释、各元函数解释和各元关系解释；因此\n定义式中不再出现未与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span>绑定的游离论域。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-structure-—-S-Structure-$\\mathfrak{A}$","text":"df-structure — S-Structure $\\mathfrak{A}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-symbol]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ (candidate signature, see [[88-df-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$c^{\\mathfrak{A}}$ : 常量$c$在$\\mathfrak{A}$中的解释 (see [[88-df-symbol]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","head